        "created_at": "2015-04-01T00:40:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The title pretty much says what I am wondering. &nbsp;I have watched a number of the tournament videos and it was a big deal when I saw someone pick The Operative, but I never ever see Proletariat. &nbsp;Why is that?</p>",
