      {
        "id": 138722,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-01T02:06:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the meta and maps have a lot to do with prole not being used.</p><p>What we need to see is one really good Beacon-Prole match, but I don't know if anyone is going to be able to pull it off in a big match on the current map style.</p><p>Proletariat is a great stall and finish character, but in wide open maps his natural tendency to cluster makes him pretty easy to control.</p><p>He is also pretty easy to counterpick, Baron, Operative and AZ all can just crush Prole through defensive sacrifice or shared burden.</p><p>I wonder if we'll see Prole at all really, because we are going to add a ton of characters to the roster, and Prole is already limited in scope of use.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:15:17.896Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
