        "raw": "<p>I think the meta and maps have a lot to do with prole not being used.</p><p>What we need to see is one really good Beacon-Prole match, but I don&#39;t know if anyone is going to be able to pull it off in a big match on the current map style.</p><p>Proletariat is a great stall and finish character, but in wide open maps his natural tendency to cluster makes him pretty easy to control.</p><p>He is also pretty easy to counterpick, Baron, Operative and AZ all can just crush Prole through defensive sacrifice or shared burden.</p><p>I wonder if we&#39;ll see Prole at all really, because we are going to add a ton of characters to the roster, and Prole is already limited in scope of use.</p>",
