      {
        "id": 138723,
        "name": "Dolph",
        "username": "Dolph",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f6c823/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-02T16:44:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for all the answers. &nbsp;I did go back and find some of those threads where this issue was discussed previously. &nbsp;I just like the concept of proletariat and wanted to get some information on his use. &nbsp;It was also an attempt to get an idea as to whether there are character balance issues in the game. &nbsp;The fact that there are some characters that rarely or never see play concerns me. &nbsp;I do however agree that as more and more people develop experience the harder to play characters might see a little more use.</p>",
